					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It feels a tad overlong in the middle, I like all of the material here and there isn’t anything I can point to as being fat, reading it just made me feel as though the same content could be stated in less space. I’ll have to go through with a fine tipped comb to pick out what made me feel that way. That’s really just a nitpick, this encapsulates a lot of the internet’s disaster paranoia and filters it through Oneiroi effectively. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
